Suggestion : It would be nice to be able to destroy objects.

I am often faced with a dungeon littered with things; one
level I have left has 20 or so leather armors, a dozen black caps, and
piles upon piles of rocks. When I go up & down between levels I am constantly
faced with having to recheck piles of things to see what's in them.
This gets especially bad when monsters move things around!

The only conceivable use for all these things would be polymorphing,
but I don't have a poly wand and I already own the best armor, helm,
etc that I could want.  (In addition to having NO patience). 
Yes, I could put everything in chests, but picking it all up and
then going through the putting something in a chest is more than 
I can bear (even when compared to a dirty dungeon!).

What would be nice is if there was some way to obliterate objects;
some wand of destruction, maybe kicking things, or just pounding on
them with a pickaxe.  ANYTHING to help me reduce the confusion and
clutter of being on the lower levels.








